  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario de tecnología**",
      "",
      "| Acción | Verbo | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| iniciar / cerrar sesión | *log in · log out* | *I can't **log in** to my account.* |",
      "| descargar / subir | *download · upload* | *Please **upload** the file.* |",
      "| instalar / actualizar | *install · update* | *The app needs to **update**.* |",
      "| encender / apagar | *turn on · turn off* | *Turn it off and on again.* |",
      "| conectar | *plug in · connect · pair* | *Plug in the charger.* |",
      "| guardar / copia | *save · back up* | *Back up your photos.* |",
      "| borrar | *delete · remove* | *Delete old files.* |",
      "",
      "**Describir problemas**",
      "",
      "- *My phone **keeps** crashing / freezing.* (se cuelga una y otra vez)",
      "- *The battery **runs out** / **dies** quickly.*",
      "- *The screen is **cracked** / **blank**.*",
      "- *I've **run out of** storage / space.*",
      "",
      "**Keep + -ing** = hacer algo repetidamente: *It keeps disconnecting.*",
      "",
      "**Comparar aparatos:** *This laptop is lighter and faster than my old one. · The battery lasts longer.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** *notebook* no es portátil (es cuaderno; en inglés americano a veces); *computer* /kəmˈpjuːtə/ lleva acento en la segunda sílaba. *Wi-Fi* se pronuncia /ˈwaɪ faɪ/. *Mobile* /ˈməʊbaɪl/ (UK) = *cell phone* (EE. UU.). *Charger* /ˈtʃɑːdʒə/ (no 'cargador de cargar' con 'ch' española).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *password* /ˈpɑːswɜːd/ · *router* /ˈruːtə/ (UK) o /ˈraʊtər/ (US) · *battery* /ˈbætri/ (2-3 sílabas)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "It keeps to crash.",
        "right": "It keeps crashing.",
        "note": "Keep + -ing."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I connect me to Wi-Fi.",
        "right": "I connect to Wi-Fi.",
        "note": "No uses 'me'."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": [
